WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.017
Energy usually moves in patterns rather than staying flat all day.

00:00:04.017 --> 00:00:09.715
Many people have windows when focus comes more easily and windows when startup friction is higher.

00:00:09.715 --> 00:00:12.208
Some people do their clearest thinking early.

00:00:12.208 --> 00:00:13.633
Others become sharper later.

00:00:13.633 --> 00:00:17.906
Some notice an afternoon dip, especially after intense cognitive or social work.

00:00:17.906 --> 00:00:20.043
These patterns are not moral traits.

00:00:20.043 --> 00:00:21.468
They are planning information.

00:00:21.468 --> 00:00:24.317
Startup friction is the effort required to begin.

00:00:24.317 --> 00:00:28.946
It is often higher after a context switch, a break, a stressful interaction,

00:00:28.946 --> 00:00:30.371
or an unclear task.

00:00:30.371 --> 00:00:34.288
Good systems reduce startup friction by making the next action obvious,

00:00:34.288 --> 00:00:38.918
keeping materials ready, and avoiding unnecessary decisions at the moment work should begin.

00:00:38.918 --> 00:00:43.548
Energy-aware planning pays attention to the start of work, not just the deadline.

00:00:43.548 --> 00:00:45.685
Recovery after intense work also matters.

00:00:45.685 --> 00:00:49.246
A difficult incident, a long facilitation session, a creative push,

00:00:49.246 --> 00:00:54.944
or several hours of deep analysis may require a lower-demand transition before the next demanding task.

00:00:54.944 --> 00:00:58.149
Seasonal pressures, caregiving responsibilities, travel, health context, workload spikes,

00:00:58.149 --> 00:01:00.998
and major life events can all change capacity.

00:01:00.998 --> 00:01:06.696
A system that assumes every day should look the same will misread normal variation as failure.

00:01:06.696 --> 00:01:08.477
Observation helps without becoming obsessive.

00:01:08.477 --> 00:01:13.463
A simple weekly note can identify when deep work went well, when energy dipped,

00:01:13.463 --> 00:01:15.955
what drained capacity, and what helped recovery.

00:01:15.955 --> 00:01:18.805
The purpose is not to measure every sensation.

00:01:18.805 --> 00:01:21.297
The purpose is to plan more honestly.

00:01:21.297 --> 00:01:25.571
When patterns are visible, people can protect better windows, reduce predictable drains,

00:01:25.571 --> 00:01:28.420
and avoid forcing high-consequence work into weak conditions.
